            "review_level": "official-record-and-unmodified-pinned-code-execution",
            "review": {
              "ja": "LANL公式書誌と固定commit 9bacc477eb791e959c9621e771fc7a725db755faのNohコードを確認・別実行。gamma=5/3,rho0=|u0|=1に限定し、点値と衝撃を分割したGauss積分で参照保存量平均を照合。3次元の解析参照検査は球対称PDEの実行を意味しません。",
              "en": "Checked the LANL software record and separately executed unmodified Noh code at commit 9bacc477eb791e959c9621e771fc7a725db755fa. Cross-checks use only gamma=5/3 and rho0=|u0|=1: points and shock-split Gauss integration of conservative means. Geometry-3 reference checks are not a spherical PDE execution."
