  "depth_scope": {
    "ja": "圧力をゼロから始めるNoh問題を、独自の小型1D有限体積ソルバーで平面・円筒半径対称に計算します。64/128/256/512格子で体積重み誤差、衝撃位置、密度増幅、原点過熱、外側流入を含む質量・全エネルギー収支を別々に測ります。",
    "en": "A small original 1D finite-volume solver advances the Noh problem from exactly zero pressure, in planar and cylindrical-radial symmetry. Grids 64/128/256/512 separately measure volume-weighted errors, shock location, density amplification, origin heating and mass/total-energy budgets including outer inflow."
  },
